{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19666","headline":"道州夏日郡内北桥新亭书怀赠何元二处士 · 吕温","name":"道州夏日郡内北桥新亭书怀赠何元二处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结构池梁上，登临日几回。\n晴空交密叶，阴岸积苍苔。\n爽气中央满，清风四面来。\n振衣生羽翰，高枕出尘埃。\n齐物鱼何乐，忘机鸟不猜。\n闲销炎昼静，选胜火云开。\n僻远宜孱性，优游赖废材。\n愿爲长泛梗，莫作重然灰。\n守道穷非过，先时动是灾。\n寄言徐孺子，宾榻旦徘徊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}